### AI Assistance Disclosure (ETHGlobal Hackathon Compliance)
In compliance with ETHGlobal hackathon guidelines and AI disclosure requirements:
- Large Language Models and AI coding assistants (including Google DeepMind Antigravity) were utilized as collaborative pair-programming tools during the research, implementation, schema mapping, and test suite verification of this project.
- All cryptographic keys, network connections, security boundaries, and architectural integration with Arkiv, 0G Private Computer, and Rabdi Testnet were designed, verified, and audited by the project team.

